  // 🎬 电影海报 14 种类型
  movie_romance:
    "IMPORTANT: This is a CINEMA MOVIE POSTER — NOT a magazine cover. Do NOT include any magazine wordmark (no VOGUE, no GQ, no TIME, no fashion magazine logos), no magazine issue numbers, no magazine coverline structure. Only movie-poster elements (movie title, cast names, release date, MPAA rating, credits block). Transform the person in this photo into the lead of a ROMANCE MOVIE POSTER. Keep their face and identity recognizable. Style as a romantic lead — soft warm lighting, tender contemplative expression with longing gaze, embracing or thoughtful pose, possibly with a partner silhouette suggested behind. Warm golden-hour or candlelit color palette in honey/rose/peach tones, cinematic shallow depth of field, romantic atmospheric background (sunset beach, Paris cafe, autumn park, candle-lit interior). Photography style: Hollywood romance movie poster with warm golden cinematography. Include cinematic poster layout — elegant serif title at the bottom, smaller cast names above the title with 'AND' connectors, 'IN THEATERS' release date below the title, romantic tagline like 'LOVE IS WORTH THE WAIT', classic credits block at the very bottom with director/music/production credits, MPAA rating box. Hollywood romance movie poster layout.",
  movie_comedy:
    "IMPORTANT: This is a CINEMA MOVIE POSTER — NOT a magazine cover. No magazine wordmarks, no issue numbers, no magazine coverlines. Only movie-poster elements. Transform the person in this photo into the lead of a COMEDY MOVIE POSTER. Keep their face and identity recognizable. Style as a comedic everyman with playful exaggerated expression — wide goofy smile, raised eyebrow, surprised funny look, comedic mid-action pose holding silly props, casual relatable clothing. Bright cheerful color palette with primary colors (yellow, red, blue), white or playful scenic background, studio comedy lighting bright and clean. Photography style: bright glossy Hollywood comedy poster (think Apatow or Will-Ferrell comedies). Include cinematic poster layout — bold playful chunky title at the bottom in fun bold sans-serif typography, cast names above with comedy duo/trio billing, 'COMING SOON' or 'THIS SUMMER' date tag, comedic tagline like 'IT'S GOING TO BE A WILD RIDE' or 'EXPECT THE UNEXPECTED', credits block, PG-13 rating. Hollywood comedy movie poster layout.",
  movie_drama:
    "IMPORTANT: This is a CINEMA MOVIE POSTER — NOT a magazine cover. No magazine wordmarks, no issue numbers, no magazine coverlines. Only movie-poster elements. Transform the person in this photo into the lead of an OSCAR-CALIBER PRESTIGE DRAMA MOVIE POSTER. Keep their face and identity recognizable. Style as a serious dramatic lead — deeply contemplative emotional expression, restrained powerful presence, refined understated attire, dramatic chiaroscuro lighting with deep shadows. Monochrome or muted earthy color palette. Cinematic intimate close-up portrait or atmospheric environmental shot with negative space. Photography style: Academy-Award-style prestige drama poster (Manchester by the Sea, Moonlight, Nomadland aesthetic). Include cinematic poster layout — minimal elegant title at the bottom in classic refined serif typography, cast names with 'AND' tags, prestigious credits with multiple FILM FESTIVAL LAURELS (CANNES, VENICE, TORONTO), 'WINNER BEST PICTURE' or 'OSCAR NOMINATED' tags, classic prestige drama credits block. Prestige Oscar-style drama movie poster layout.",
  movie_animation:
    "IMPORTANT: This is a CINEMA MOVIE POSTER — NOT a magazine cover. No magazine wordmarks, no issue numbers, no magazine coverlines. Only movie-poster elements. Transform the person in this photo into the cover character of a FAMILY-FRIENDLY ANIMATION MOVIE POSTER (Pixar/Disney/Studio Ghibli aesthetic). Render the subject as a stylized 3D Pixar-style or 2D hand-drawn Disney/Ghibli-style cartoon character (NOT a photo, but a cute animated cartoon illustration). Translate the subject's recognizable features into charming cartoon proportions (larger expressive eyes, smoother stylized features, charming animated proportions). Vibrant cheerful color palette, magical fantasy adventure background (enchanted forest, sky kingdom, underwater realm, candy-colored fairy land, dragon mountain). Expressive cute cartoon hero pose with optimistic energy. Pure cartoon animation illustration style. Include cinematic poster layout — playful chunky title at the bottom in fun rounded fonts (could be 3D-styled), supporting character silhouettes around the edges, 'THIS HOLIDAY SEASON' or 'COMING SOON' release tag, animation studio logo placeholder, magical tagline. Family animation movie poster layout, vibrant magical cartoon illustration.",
  movie_crime:
    "IMPORTANT: This is a CINEMA MOVIE POSTER — NOT a magazine cover. No magazine wordmarks, no issue numbers, no magazine coverlines. Only movie-poster elements. Transform the person in this photo into the lead of a NEO-NOIR CRIME MOVIE POSTER. Keep their face and identity recognizable. Style as a brooding crime drama lead — intense dangerous shadowed expression, half-lit face from a single dramatic light source, sharp detective trench coat or sleek dark suit, atmospheric cigarette smoke (no weapons shown), dim-lit urban setting with neon noir reflections behind. Dark moody color palette with strong red/amber accents against deep shadow. Photography style: neo-noir crime poster (Taxi Driver, Drive, classic Wong-Kar-wai noir aesthetic). Include cinematic poster layout — bold edgy title at the bottom in stark serif or stenciled typography, cast names above, atmospheric blood-red and black color palette, dark tagline like 'EVERY SECRET HAS A PRICE'. Neo-noir crime movie poster layout.",
  movie_horror:
    "IMPORTANT: This is a CINEMA MOVIE POSTER — NOT a magazine cover. No magazine wordmarks, no issue numbers, no magazine coverlines. Only movie-poster elements. Transform the person in this photo into the cover of an ATMOSPHERIC HORROR MOVIE POSTER (psychological horror, NOT graphic gore). Keep their face and identity recognizable. Style as a haunted horror protagonist — pale moonlit skin, intense haunted wide-eyed unsettled expression, eerie atmospheric pose. Dark color palette with deep blacks, sickly greens, and cold blues. Atmospheric horror lighting with a single dim light source casting long unsettling shadows. Possibly with a shadowy ominous presence suggested behind. Photography style: A24-horror atmospheric poster (Hereditary, The Witch, atmospheric not graphic). NO blood, NO gore, just psychological unsettling atmosphere. Include cinematic poster layout — distressed cracked horror title at the bottom in stark serif or unsettling typography, cast names above, 'COMING THIS HALLOWEEN' or 'OCTOBER 31', horror tagline like 'EVIL HAS A NEW FACE'. Atmospheric horror movie poster layout.",
  movie_thriller:
    "IMPORTANT: This is a CINEMA MOVIE POSTER — NOT a magazine cover. No magazine wordmarks, no issue numbers, no magazine coverlines. Only movie-poster elements. Transform the person in this photo into the lead of a PSYCHOLOGICAL THRILLER MOVIE POSTER. Keep their face and identity recognizable. Style as a tense thriller protagonist — alert wary expression with paranoia, determination, or hidden mystery, sharp shadows slashing across the face, urban evening setting with stark directional lighting. Cold color palette with deep blue-grey and accent slashes of red. Cinematic shallow depth of field, very dramatic atmosphere. Photography style: psychological thriller poster (Gone Girl, Prisoners, Zodiac aesthetic). Include cinematic poster layout — sharp angular title at the bottom in stark modern sans-serif, cast names above, mysterious tagline like 'THE TRUTH IS UNTHINKABLE', 'COMING SOON' release date, thriller credits block. Psychological thriller movie poster layout.",
  movie_disaster:
    "IMPORTANT: This is a CINEMA MOVIE POSTER — NOT a magazine cover. No magazine wordmarks, no issue numbers, no magazine coverlines. Only movie-poster elements. Transform the person in this photo into the lead of a DISASTER BLOCKBUSTER MOVIE POSTER. Keep their face and identity recognizable. Style as a determined survivor hero — intense focused desperate expression, weathered hero look (disheveled hair, ash smudges, intense gaze showing they've been through hell), dramatic action stance. Background shows a catastrophe scene — burning city skyline, tidal wave, earthquake ruins, distant fire, tornado funnel, or apocalyptic event with smoke and rubble. Dramatic high-contrast lighting with orange-red apocalyptic glow. Hollywood blockbuster disaster photography. Include cinematic poster layout — massive bold title at the bottom in distressed metallic 3D typography, smaller cast names above, 'EXPERIENCE THE END' or apocalyptic tagline, 'IN THEATERS' release date, big-budget disaster movie credits block. Hollywood disaster blockbuster movie poster layout.",
  movie_arthouse:
    "IMPORTANT: This is a CINEMA MOVIE POSTER — NOT a magazine cover. No magazine wordmarks, no issue numbers, no magazine coverlines. Only movie-poster elements. Transform the person in this photo into the lead of an ARTHOUSE INDIE FILM POSTER (Cannes/Sundance/A24 aesthetic). Keep their face and identity recognizable. Style as an enigmatic arthouse protagonist — pensive understated expression with subtle emotional depth, soft natural lighting, minimal restrained styling, evocative atmospheric environmental setting, painterly cinematography with film grain quality. Muted earthy or pastel color palette (soft pink, dusty blue, sage green, sandy beige). Photography style: A24-style indie film poster (Past Lives, Aftersun, Wong Kar-wai aesthetic), painterly with film grain. Include cinematic poster layout — minimal elegant title at the bottom in clean modern serif, sparse credits, multiple FILM FESTIVAL LAURELS (CANNES, SUNDANCE, BERLINALE, TIFF), evocative arthouse tagline, A24-style credits block. Minimalist arthouse indie movie poster layout.",
  movie_documentary:
    "IMPORTANT: This is a CINEMA MOVIE POSTER — NOT a magazine cover. No magazine wordmarks, no issue numbers, no magazine coverlines. Only movie-poster elements. Transform the person in this photo into the subject of a DOCUMENTARY FILM POSTER. Keep their face and identity recognizable. Style as a real-world documentary subject — natural unposed authentic expression, documentary-realism photography quality (raw natural feel, no glamorous retouching), environmental portrait showing context (in their workplace, hometown, or field of work), natural daylight or natural ambient lighting. Photography style: National Geographic documentary photography crossed with Sundance documentary poster aesthetic. Include cinematic poster layout — bold documentary title at the bottom in serif typography, descriptive subtitle explaining the documentary topic, 'A FILM BY [DIRECTOR NAME]', multiple festival selection laurels (SUNDANCE, TRIBECA, IDFA), 'A DOCUMENTARY' tag, documentary credits block. Documentary film poster layout.",
  movie_action:
    "IMPORTANT: This is a CINEMA MOVIE POSTER — NOT a magazine cover. No magazine wordmarks, no issue numbers, no magazine coverlines. Only movie-poster elements. Transform the person in this photo into the lead of an ACTION BLOCKBUSTER MOVIE POSTER. Keep their face and identity recognizable. Style as an action hero — intense determined warrior expression, dynamic mid-action pose suggesting motion (no explicit weapons shown — action implied through pose and lighting), weathered hero look (slight grime, intense gaze), tactical or combat-ready outfit, explosive atmospheric action background (collapsing city, motorcycle chase trails, mountain peak, helicopter shadow). Signature teal-and-orange Hollywood blockbuster color grade. Strong dramatic rim lighting. Photography style: Marvel/James-Bond/Fast-and-Furious blockbuster poster. Include cinematic poster layout — massive bold title at the bottom in metallic 3D action typography, smaller cast names above, 'IN THEATERS [DATE]' release info, action tagline like 'ONE MAN. ONE MISSION.', blockbuster credits block. Hollywood action blockbuster movie poster layout.",
  movie_scifi:
    "IMPORTANT: This is a CINEMA MOVIE POSTER — NOT a magazine cover. No magazine wordmarks, no issue numbers, no magazine coverlines. Only movie-poster elements. Transform the person in this photo into the lead of a SCI-FI MOVIE POSTER (Blade Runner / Dune / Interstellar aesthetic). Keep their face and identity recognizable. Style as a sci-fi protagonist — intense visionary determined expression, futuristic or alien-influenced costume (space suit, cyberpunk tactical jacket, neon-trim futuristic outfit, alien-fashion robes), atmospheric sci-fi background (alien desert planet, neon cyberpunk megacity, spaceship interior with displays, distant nebula and stars). Cool blue-purple-silver futuristic color palette with neon accents (electric blue, hot pink, lime green highlights). Photography style: prestige blockbuster sci-fi poster cinematography. Include cinematic poster layout — futuristic bold title at the bottom in sans-serif sci-fi font (could be retro-futuristic or sleek modern), cast names above, futuristic release date format, sci-fi tagline like 'THE FUTURE AWAITS' or 'BEYOND THE STARS', sci-fi credits block. Sci-fi movie poster layout.",
  movie_wuxia:
    "IMPORTANT: This is a CINEMA MOVIE POSTER — NOT a magazine cover. No magazine wordmarks, no issue numbers, no magazine coverlines. Only movie-poster elements. Transform the person in this photo into the lead of a CHINESE WUXIA (martial arts fantasy) MOVIE POSTER. Keep their face and identity recognizable. Style as a wuxia hero — long flowing hair, traditional Chinese hanfu or wuxia robes in flowing silk fabric (white, red, or black), graceful elegant pose mid-flight, sword stance, or contemplative warrior pose, traditional Chinese architecture or misty mountain bamboo grove background, ink-painting cinematography quality, dramatic wind suggested in flowing hair and robes. Cool natural palette with bold red accent (traditional wuxia film coloring). Photography style: classic wuxia movie poster (Hero, Crouching Tiger Hidden Dragon, House of Flying Daggers, Shadow aesthetic). Include cinematic poster layout — elegant Chinese-calligraphy-style title at the bottom (could be vertical Chinese calligraphy or horizontal stylized brush-stroke title), smaller cast names in Chinese characters, poetic wuxia tagline, traditional Chinese red ink-stamp seal, wuxia film credits. Wuxia martial arts movie poster layout.",
  movie_western:
    "IMPORTANT: This is a CINEMA MOVIE POSTER — NOT a magazine cover. No magazine wordmarks, no issue numbers, no magazine coverlines. Only movie-poster elements. Transform the person in this photo into the lead of a WESTERN MOVIE POSTER. Keep their face and identity recognizable. Style as a Western gunslinger or outlaw — weathered tanned sun-baked skin, intense steely gaze, classic cowboy hat (Stetson), leather duster coat or dusty wool vest with bandana, possibly with a tin sheriff's star or boot spurs visible (no weapons shown — Western mood implied through costume and setting), sun-baked desert mesa or frontier town main-street background, vintage Western film grain quality. Warm sepia, dust-tone, and burnt-orange sunset color palette. Photography style: classic Western movie poster (Clint Eastwood spaghetti-western, True Grit, or The Hateful Eight aesthetic). Include cinematic poster layout — bold serif title at the bottom in vintage Western wood-type typography, cast names above, 'COMING SOON' or vintage release date, gritty Western tagline like 'JUSTICE HAS A NAME', vintage credits block. Classic Western movie poster layout.",
  popeye:
    "Transform the person in this photo into a POPEYE magazine (Japanese 'Magazine for City Boys') cover subject. Keep their face and identity exactly the same. Casual yet stylish Tokyo city-boy fashion — vintage tees, chinos, sneakers, denim, ivy-league or workwear influences. Soft natural daylight, clean white or pastel background, playful relaxed pose with a slight smile, approachable youthful aesthetic. Japanese magazine photography style, retro film grain feel, ultra-detailed. Include the iconic POPEYE bold wordmark at the top, the tagline 'Magazine for City Boys', colorful coverline blocks with mixed Japanese and English text (mention CITY BOY, TOKYO, FASHION), issue number, and Japanese price (¥830). Japanese youth fashion magazine cover layout.",
  brutus:
    "Transform the person in this photo into a BRUTUS magazine (Japanese sophisticated culture/lifestyle magazine) cover subject. Keep their face and identity exactly the same. Refined, intellectual Japanese editorial portrait, minimalist styling — neutral tones, well-tailored casual elegance, a thoughtful contemplative expression. Clean off-white or cream background, soft even lighting, sophisticated and grown-up aesthetic. Japanese culture magazine photography style, ultra-detailed. Include the BRUTUS italic serif wordmark big at the top, a large feature theme word in Japanese mincho serif (e.g., '特集'), a clean horizontal divider line, issue info in Japanese (No.1043, ¥780), and the tagline 'A magazine of lifestyle and culture'. BRUTUS minimalist Japanese cover layout.",
  andpremium:
    "Transform the person in this photo into an &Premium magazine (Japanese women's lifestyle magazine) cover subject. Keep their face and identity exactly the same. Soft, dreamy lifestyle portrait with warm cream/beige tones, natural casual fashion (linen, knitwear, soft neutrals), gentle thoughtful expression, soft natural side lighting, lots of breathing room around the subject. Refined Japanese 'better life' aesthetic, ultra-detailed and serene. Include the elegant '&Premium' italic serif wordmark at the top, the tagline 'THE GUIDE TO A BETTER LIFE', subtle mincho Japanese subtitle '特集', issue No.124, ¥850, and small mentions of LIFESTYLE · TRAVEL · FOOD · CULTURE. Clean minimalist warm-toned Japanese magazine layout.",
  ginza:
    "Transform the person in this photo into a GINZA magazine (Tokyo women's high-fashion magazine) cover subject. Keep their face and identity exactly the same. Bold Tokyo girl fashion editorial — striking modern outfit (could be designer streetwear or chic minimal looks), confident pose, dramatic styling with attitude. Studio or urban Tokyo backdrop, sharp directional lighting, fashion-forward and unapologetic aesthetic. Japanese high-fashion photography, ultra-detailed. Include the GINZA bold sans-serif wordmark at top left, pink accent line and pink details, Japanese coverlines mixed with English (mention TOKYO GIRLS, BEAUTY, FASHION 2026, '今、本当に欲しいもの'), issue info No.318, ¥980. Tokyo fashion magazine cover layout.",
  numero:
    "Transform the person in this photo into a Numéro TOKYO magazine cover subject. Keep their face and identity exactly the same. Avant-garde, high-fashion artistic editorial portrait — bold conceptual styling, dramatic moody lighting with strong shadows, sophisticated dark color palette, intense thoughtful expression, art-meets-fashion aesthetic. Could include unexpected fashion or artistic styling. Japanese avant-garde fashion photography, ultra-detailed cinematic quality. Include the elegant italic serif 'Numéro' wordmark at the top with 'T O K Y O' spaced beneath, dramatic coverlines like AVANT-GARDE FASHION NOW, ART EXCLUSIVE INTERVIEW, Japanese subtitles mincho serif, issue No.156, ¥1,200. Avant-garde Japanese fashion magazine layout.",
  mensnonno:
    "Transform the person in this photo into a Men's Non-no magazine (Japanese men's street fashion magazine) cover subject. Keep their face and identity exactly the same. Trendy Japanese street-fashion look — layered casual outfit, possibly with vibrant accents, modern menswear styling, friendly approachable pose with a slight smile, youthful energy. Soft daylight, urban Tokyo or studio backdrop, accessible 'boy-next-door' charm meets fashion-forward edge. Japanese men's fashion magazine photography style, ultra-detailed. Include the 'Men's Non-no' wordmark at top (italic serif 'Men's' + bold orange 'Non-no'), orange accent line, playful coverlines mixing Japanese and English (mention STREET STYLE 2026, '今着たい', '100 LOOKS', メンズ最旬コーデ), a bright yellow 'NEW ISSUE!' circular badge, issue No.564 ¥720. Japanese men's street fashion magazine layout.",
  linnel:
    "Redraw the person in this photo as the cover star of Linnel (リンネル), a Japanese natural-lifestyle magazine for women in their 30s-40s focused on slow living and gentle homemade life. Keep their face and identity recognizable. Soft, calm, natural portrait — wearing linen and cotton natural-fiber clothing in warm earth tones (oatmeal, beige, soft cream, dusty rose), a gentle thoughtful expression with a soft smile, soft natural window light, in a Kyoto-style wooden interior or simple natural environment with plants, organic styling, lots of breathing room around the subject. Photography style: muted warm-toned natural-light photography with subtle film grain, soft warm color palette emphasizing cream and beige, calm serene aesthetic. Ultra-detailed glossy magazine quality. Include the elegant italic serif 'Linnel' wordmark at the top center in dark brown, the small Japanese tagline 'リンネル — 心がふっと軽くなる暮らしのヒント', minimal serene Japanese coverlines (特集, 心地よい暮らし方, SLOW LIFE · NATURAL · HOMEMADE · KYOTO), thin decorative lines, issue No.224 ¥920, 宝島社. Minimal Japanese natural-lifestyle magazine cover layout with cream-colored whitespace.",
  story:
    "Redraw the person in this photo as the cover star of STORY (ストーリィ), a Japanese fashion magazine for elegant sophisticated women in their forties. Keep their face and identity recognizable. Polished mature elegant portrait — wearing sophisticated luxury fashion (well-tailored elegant outfit such as cashmere, silk blouse, or refined coat), refined accessories like pearls or quality leather, confident dignified expression showing graceful maturity, professional studio lighting with soft warm gold tones, elegant clean blurred background. Photography style: high-end mature fashion editorial with soft glamour lighting, ultra-detailed glossy magazine quality. Include the elegant italic 'STORY' wordmark at the top center in bold Bodoni-style serif, gold accent line beneath, the Japanese tagline 'for women in their forties — 美しく、自分らしく', refined Japanese coverlines about elegant maturity (40代の輝き, ELEGANT BEAUTY, 本当に上質な大人の装い, BEAUTY 美容医学, アラフォーのための), issue date, ¥850, 光文社. Mature elegant Japanese women's fashion magazine cover layout with gold accents.",
  sweet:
    "Redraw the person in this photo as the cover star of sweet (スウィート), a Japanese women's fashion magazine known for cute pink covers and famous luxury-brand collaboration freebies. Keep their face and identity recognizable. Bright cheerful cute fashion portrait — wearing fashionable sweet-style outfit with pastel or soft girly tones, sweet feminine expression with a bright happy smile, soft pink-cream studio lighting, polished glossy commercial photography quality. Photography style: bright cheerful Japanese commercial photography emphasizing cuteness, ultra-glossy magazine quality. Include the iconic large pink italic 'sweet' wordmark in cursive serif at the top center, the Japanese tagline 'スウィート — ハッピー & キュート', a giant burst-shaped pink badge prominently reading '特別付録 豪華 BRAND BAG' (the iconic sweet-magazine freebie callout), small heart decorations, cute Japanese coverlines (巻頭オールカラー, happy & kawaii), issue info ¥1,200, 宝島社, pink bottom banner. Cute pink Japanese women's magazine cover layout, super sweet bubbly and feminine.",
  vivi:
    "Redraw the person in this photo as the cover star of ViVi (ヴィヴィ), a Japanese fashion and beauty magazine for women in their early twenties heavily influenced by K-beauty and K-pop trends. Keep their face and identity recognizable. Vibrant trendy K-influenced portrait — wearing trendy K-pop / Y2K fashion with bold colors, trendy hair (possibly colorful streaks), confident playful expression, dramatic colorful studio lighting, hot pink or saturated colorful background. Photography style: high-saturation glossy Japanese magazine photography with K-beauty aesthetic, ultra-detailed glossy quality, modern and energetic. Include the iconic large italic 'ViVi' wordmark in bold serif at the top on a hot pink banner, yellow accent line, dense and energetic Japanese coverlines (K-BEAUTY 全攻略 アイドル級美肌の作り方, OOTD 100 韓国ストリート最新), a hot-pink circular '独占 INTERVIEW K-POP IDOL' stamp badge, issue info ¥780, 講談社. High-saturation Japanese K-beauty fashion magazine cover layout.",
  voce:
    "Redraw the person in this photo as the cover star of VoCE (ヴォーチェ), Japan's top beauty magazine focused on cosmetics, skincare and makeup. Keep their face and identity recognizable. Beauty-focused close-up portrait — clean polished professional Japanese makeup look with detailed sophisticated eye makeup, glowing flawless skin, glossy lips, focused tightly on the head and shoulders showing skin and makeup details (not full body), bright clean even studio lighting that emphasizes flawless skin texture and makeup quality, clean white or pale background. Photography style: high-end beauty editorial closeup photography with crisp clean lighting that shows makeup details, ultra-detailed glossy magazine quality. Include the bold italic 'VoCE' wordmark in Bodoni serif at the top center in black, pink accent line, small Japanese beauty-focused tag callouts (BEST COSME ベストコスメ大賞, 美肌 PORE-LESS SKIN), Japanese coverlines about beauty (BEAUTY EDITORIAL · ヴォーチェ, COVER STORY 特集), issue info ¥720, 講談社, bottom 'MAKEUP · SKINCARE · HAIR · WELLNESS' tagline. Japanese beauty magazine cover layout with closeup beauty photography emphasis.",
  nonno:
    "Redraw the person in this photo as the cover star of non-no (ノンノ / non・no), a Japanese women's fashion magazine published by Shueisha for college-age women (18-22). Keep their face and identity recognizable. Soft elegant fashion portrait — polished but approachable young-adult fashion model look, wearing chic simple outfit in clean cream/beige/white tones, soft natural studio lighting, neutral clean background, a refined but accessible 大学生 (college girl) aesthetic. Photography style: clean Japanese commercial fashion photography with soft natural light, ultra-detailed glossy magazine quality. Include the iconic lowercase italic 'non・no' wordmark at top center in deep navy with the signature interpunct dot, the subtitle 'ノンノ · SUMMER FASHION & BEAUTY BOOK', refined Japanese coverlines (SUMMER FASHION & BEAUTY BOOK 100 LOOKS, 大学生最旬コーデ全集, 巻頭スペシャル), issue No.624 ¥780, 集英社, bottom 'FASHION · BEAUTY · LIFE · CULTURE' tagline. Japanese college-girl fashion magazine cover layout.",
  seventeen:
    "Redraw the person in this photo as the cover star of Seventeen (セブンティーン / ST), a Japanese fashion magazine in the spirit of bright youthful idol-girl style published by Shueisha. Keep their face and identity recognizable. Bright cheerful youthful portrait — wearing trendy casual fashion (could be smart casual blazer-and-pleated-skirt outfit, cute knitwear, or stylish street fashion), fresh natural makeup, big bright happy smile, joyful idol-pop energy, soft bright studio lighting, vibrant cyan/turquoise/sky-blue background. Photography style: bright cheerful Japanese youth fashion magazine photography, ultra-glossy magazine quality. Include the bold italic 'Seventeen' wordmark in DM Serif at the top on a red banner, a tilted yellow rectangle banner reading 'STの推し私服!' (ST favorite outfits), a pink circular 'ドキドキ LOVE!' badge, a yellow 'おしゃれコーデ 100!!' (stylish coordinates 100 looks) badge, vibrant Japanese youth fashion coverlines, issue ¥600, 集英社 (Shueisha), bottom red banner 'ST · 今、全部ここに!'. Japanese bright youth-idol fashion magazine cover layout.",
  ray:
    "Redraw the person in this photo as the cover star of Ray (レイ), a Japanese women's fashion magazine for the '愛されガール' (beloved feminine girl) style published by Shufunotomosha. Keep their face and identity recognizable. Soft feminine portrait — wearing cute elegant feminine outfit (knitwear, blouse, soft pastels or cream tones), relaxed gentle pose with a soft sweet smile, soft warm creamy lighting, beige/cream/warm-brown background, dreamy beloved-girl aesthetic. Photography style: soft warm-toned Japanese commercial fashion photography with cream tones, ultra-detailed glossy magazine quality. Include the elegant italic 'Ray' wordmark in DM Serif at the top center in warm brown, the subtitle 'レイ · 愛されガール御用達 MAGAZINE', a pink circular '愛されコーデ BEST 50' badge, refined feminine Japanese coverlines (COVER STAR · 巻頭特集), a small heart decoration, italic 'Sweet, Feminine, Loved.' tagline at the bottom, issue No.318 ¥780, 主婦の友社. Soft feminine Japanese women's magazine cover layout with warm cream/beige palette.",
  armag:
    "Redraw the person in this photo as the cover star of ar (アール), a Japanese fashion magazine focused on '自分磨き' (self-improvement) and healthy beauty for young women, published by Shufu to Seikatsusha. Keep their face and identity recognizable. Bright healthy energetic portrait — wearing sporty-feminine fashion or casual stylish outfit that shows a healthy fit body confidently, bright clean studio lighting, white or pale-pink background, healthy active modern-girl aesthetic with self-care focus. Photography style: bright clean modern Japanese commercial photography emphasizing health and confidence, ultra-detailed glossy magazine quality. Include the lowercase italic 'ar' wordmark in coral pink at top left, a large '7・8月号' date label, the Japanese tagline '自分磨きを頑張る女子に', a small blue 'NEW SPECIAL' circular badge, energetic Japanese coverlines (ストレスフリーで可愛いカラダ, 1 日 10 分から始める, MAKE UP, 美の習慣 100, 毎日続けたい美容ルーティン), issue ¥720, 主婦と生活社. Healthy self-care Japanese fashion magazine cover layout.",
  kogyaru:
    "Redraw the person in this photo as the cover star of KOGYARU (コギャル), a Y2K Heisei-revival Japanese gyaru subculture fashion magazine for fashion-forward adult women. Keep their face and identity recognizable. Transform into a Y2K Heisei-era gyaru aesthetic — bleached blonde or multi-color curly hair styled in Y2K fashion (Heisei-retro hair clips, decorative pins, sparkly accessories), lightly tanned skin, expressive bold gyaru makeup (dramatic colorful eye makeup with sparkly eyeshadow, defined lashes, glossy gradient lips), maximalist Y2K street fashion (vintage denim, colorful tops, layered chunky accessories, decorated long nails, platform shoes), confident peace-sign or playful pose with a bright happy smile, vibrant Harajuku-Shibuya street background or studio with neon signs, energetic Y2K nostalgia vibe. Photography style: bright saturated Japanese street-fashion photography with Y2K maximalist energy, ultra-detailed glossy quality. MASTHEAD PRIORITY: include the iconic huge yellow-and-orange 'KOGYARU' bold sans-serif wordmark as the largest title at the top of the cover with black outline; it must dominate the cover and be clearly readable. Add 'VOLUME 02 SPRING & SUMMER' label, a big '6 JUNE' date box, a small secondary 'I CAN HUSTLE' tagline only as a minor coverline, energetic Japanese coverlines about Y2K Heisei gyaru fashion (これがウチのやりかたッ!! Ryua's Style, コギャル時代到来い!! Here Comes The Age of Kogyaru, PIPIPI 世界征服, ヘイセイレトロ復活!!), maximalist Y2K cover layout. Do not use 'I CAN HUSTLE' as the main title.",
  happienuts:
    "Redraw the person in this photo as the cover star of a Japanese adult urban gyaru fashion-editorial magazine in the visual style of ハッピーナッツ (Happie). Keep their face and identity recognizable. Transform into a confident adult urban gyaru fashion-editorial portrait — long bleached blonde or honey-brown hair styled in glamorous loose waves, lightly bronzed skin tone, bold polished gyaru editorial makeup (defined eye makeup with shimmer eyeshadow, defined lashes, contoured cheekbones, glossy pink lips, manicured nails), confident chic editorial expression looking directly toward camera, polished fully dressed urban fashion outfit (tailored black blazer, tailored coat ensemble, sophisticated jumpsuit, or layered evening streetwear), atmospheric warm-toned studio lighting with soft bokeh accents in a contemporary indoor setting. Photography style: glossy high-contrast Japanese fashion-editorial photography, ultra-detailed magazine quality, mature fashion energy, not suggestive. Include the iconic huge black lowercase 'nuts' wordmark at the top, small italic 'Happie' subtitle, '[ハッピーナッツ] Summer Issue 定価650円' Japanese labels, a hot-pink circular 'Cover & Special Edition' badge with celebrity name tag, dramatic black brush-stroke title with pink-and-white text 'タフな女たちへ' (To Tough Women), italic 'NEW SEASON ATTITUDE' English tagline, 'EDITORIAL SNAPS 73 SUMMER' label, confident adult urban gyaru fashion-editorial magazine cover layout.",
  ranzuki:
    "Redraw the person in this photo as the cover star of Ranzuki (ランズキ), a sparkly pink-themed Japanese gyaru fashion magazine. Keep their face and identity recognizable. Transform into a Ranzuki feminine pink-glam gyaru style — soft pink-tinted or light honey-blonde curly hair, lightly bronzed smooth skin, sparkly feminine gyaru makeup (sparkly pink/peach eyeshadow with small star or heart decorations near eyes, glossy gradient pink lips, peachy cheeks, decorated long sparkly nails), fluffy feminine outfit (pink fur jacket, lace top, ruffled blouse, soft pastel colors), playful confident pose with hand near face, soft pink-cream background scattered with sparkles and stars, dreamy pink-themed gyaru aesthetic. Photography style: glossy soft-light Japanese fashion magazine photography emphasizing sparkle and pink palette, ultra-detailed magazine quality. Include the iconic decorative pink-and-white outlined 'Ranzuki' italic serif wordmark at the top center with a small 'Asia' subtitle, '「ランズキ」 JELLY 12月号增刊' Japanese labels, a tilted heart-shape pink badge '最新 ギャルメイク', sparkly pink banner '人気モデルの私服デニム着回しコーデ ♡', the iconic huge handwritten-style title 'カワイイって、無敵♡' (Cute is Invincible) with pink outline, 'Autumn & Winter 大作戦 !!!' Italian subtitle, a yellow 'NEW ERA UNFOLDING by Ranzuki models' tag, '神ブランド5選 おしゃれ女子大集合' coverline. Sparkly pink-themed gyaru fashion magazine cover layout, super sparkly and feminine.",
  cosplaymode:
    "Transform the person in this photo into an adult cosplayer on the cover of COSPLAY MODE (コスプレイモード), Japan's premier cosplay craft and character-costume magazine. Keep their core facial features and identity recognizable beneath the costume and makeup. Style them as a passionate adult cosplayer dressed as an anime/game/fantasy character — wearing an elaborate colorful anime-style wig (could be vivid blonde, silver-white, pink, blue, purple, or two-tone), dramatic character makeup (sharp winged eyeliner, colored contact lenses, bold eyeshadow, defined lashes, painted brows), detailed fully dressed character costume (could be fantasy armor, futuristic battle suit, cyberpunk hero, medieval/historical fantasy, or game-hero attire) with carefully crafted accessories and props. Dramatic character pose suggesting an anime/game moment. Studio lighting with dramatic shadows or atmospheric character-themed background (could be fantasy castle, sakura petals, magical sparkles, or stage lighting). Japanese cosplay magazine photography style, ultra-detailed photo with cosplay enthusiast quality. Include the iconic bold red 'COSPLAY MODE' italic-bold wordmark at the top with the MODE label in a black box, dense Japanese coverlines about cosplay techniques (実物大型紙, 特別付録, ウィッグ・衣装作り・メイク, キャラ再現完全攻略, つくる教科書), a blue circular 'COSTUME SPECIAL' badge, a tilted '特別付録 実物大型紙' red-and-white sticker, issue vol.07 ¥1,200, 'COSPLAY × CHARACTER' tagline. Japanese cosplay magazine cover layout, dense maximalist design.",
  jkegg:
    "Transform the person in this photo into the cover star of a fictional Japanese ADULT Y2K gyaru street-fashion magazine with a large pink bubble masthead reading 'JKeGG'. IMPORTANT SAFETY CONTEXT: the subject must clearly be an adult woman age 22 or older; this is adult street-fashion styling, NOT a school setting, NOT a student, NOT a minor, and NOT suggestive content. Keep their face and identity recognizable. Style the subject as a confident adult woman in trendy Y2K Egg-style gyaru fashion — honey-blonde or bleached wavy hair, lightly bronzed luminous skin, bold but tasteful gyaru makeup, glossy lips, decorated nails, cheerful confident fashion expression. Outfit: fully dressed adult Y2K street styling such as oversized blazer, knit vest or cardigan, graphic tee or collared fashion blouse without school insignia, pleated fashion skirt over opaque tights or wide-leg pants, chunky accessories, handbag, and fashion sneakers or boots. Use a Harajuku/Shibuya night street or contemporary urban fashion background. VERY IMPORTANT MAGAZINE DESIGN: make this look like a dense real Japanese fashion magazine cover, not a simple poster. Add many layered coverlines and decorative text blocks around the subject while keeping the face unobstructed: left vertical stack with 'アゲぽよGAL 大集合', '盛れるヘア', 'メイク完全攻略', 'Y2K 小物LIST'; right sidebar with small section labels 'HAIR', 'MAKE', 'NAIL', 'SNAP', 'BRAND'; top-right issue block '2012 SPRING Vol.01 / GAL STREET STYLE SPECIAL'; pink circular '500 YEN' price badge; heart-shaped sticker 'STYLE TALK SNAP'; bottom huge blue-and-white italic headline 'リアル系 春のY2K STYLE!!!'; round 'EGG 5 DAYS' badge; bottom ticker strip with tiny magazine contents such as 'STREET SNAP 100 / Y2K BRAND MIX / ADULT GAL BEAUTY / TOKYO NIGHT GUIDE'; small barcode and publisher marks. Use pink, hot-pink, white, cyan-blue, and glitter accents, multiple stickers, stars, speech bubbles, small Japanese captions, outlines, drop shadows, and crowded editorial magazine hierarchy. Bright pink-and-blue adult gyaru street-fashion magazine cover layout, highly detailed typography, maximalist cover design.",
  cosmake:
    "Transform the person in this photo into a beautifully made-up adult cosplayer on the cover of コスプレMAKE / COSMAKE, a Japanese cosplay makeup tutorial magazine. Keep their core facial features and identity recognizable. Style them as a stunning adult cosplayer with polished anime/game-character makeup — wearing an anime-style wig (blonde, silver, or anime-colored), flawless detailed character makeup with expressive adult eyes (sharp upward winged eyeliner, defined lashes, optional colored contact lenses, bold dimensional eyeshadow), refined luminous skin, glossy gradient lips, and painted-on character details. Close-up half-body or head-and-shoulders portrait emphasizing professional makeup technique and costume craftsmanship. Bright clean beauty studio lighting that highlights makeup details. Character-appropriate fully dressed costume top such as fantasy armor, elegant gothic fantasy, cyberpunk, historical fantasy, or game-hero outfit just visible at the bottom. Japanese cosplay makeup tutorial magazine photography style, ultra-detailed and glossy. Include 'アニメ&ゲーム' red small text at top left, the iconic massive 'コスプレ MAKE' wordmark (Japanese 'コスプレ' in black bold mincho + red italic bold 'MAKE' Anton), 'vol.3' label, the subtitle 'プロ級キャラメイク完全攻略!! ウィッグ＆衣装もMAKEも作ろう☆', red horizontal divider line, dense Japanese tutorial coverlines (夏コスメ・トラブル全力回避術, 極めろ! 刀キャラ, ウィッグ撮影テク, 小顔に見えるメイク術, キャラ再現 11テク, ふた重を描いて作ろう!, AR performers 特集), a small white circular 'Before/After レイヤー直伝' badge, '声優グランプリ特別編集' tag. The bottom features a black gradient with the huge italic title '今、キャラメイクがアツイ!' in white-and-yellow Anton font. Japanese cosplay makeup tutorial magazine cover layout, dense and tutorial-focused.",
  shonenjump:
    "Redraw the person in this photo as a SHONEN MANGA CHARACTER on the cover of a Japanese shonen weekly manga magazine (in the style of 週刊少年ジャンプ). Keep their facial features, hairstyle, and identity recognizable but rendered in dynamic 90s/2000s Japanese shonen manga illustration style — bold black outlines, expressive sparkling eyes, dynamic action pose, spiky stylized hair, flowing dramatic costume (could be martial arts gi, fantasy battle outfit, or school uniform), speed lines or impact effects in the background, vibrant cel-shaded colors with strong red and yellow palette. Include the iconic red 週刊少年ジャンプ wordmark at the top in bold yellow Japanese characters, multiple coverline blocks in Japanese (新連載!!, 巻頭カラー, 最終決戦へ, etc.) listing other manga titles, a bright yellow starburst badge, issue number No.28, price ¥320, and the publisher mark. Shonen Jump manga magazine cover layout, ultra-detailed manga illustration.",
  famitsu:
    "Redraw the person in this photo as the cover of a Japanese WEEKLY VIDEO GAME MAGAZINE (in the style of 週刊ファミ通). Keep their face and identity recognizable but stylized as a Japanese video game protagonist — could be a JRPG hero, action game character, or futuristic gamer-aesthetic, dynamic confident pose, stylized rendering somewhere between cel-shaded anime and photorealistic CG, dramatic gaming-inspired lighting with cool blue and red accents. Background suggests game elements or stylized abstract energy. Include the iconic blue ファミ通 wordmark at the top in bold yellow Japanese characters with '週刊' small above, a white horizontal CROSS REVIEW score box showing 4 scores (9/10/9/10 = 38/40) with Japanese label 'クロスレビュー · プラチナ殿堂入り', coverlines mentioning PS5/Switch2/Xbox in Japanese, issue No.1856, price ¥600, and '毎週木曜日発売'. Famitsu video game magazine cover layout.",
  newtype:
    "Redraw the person in this photo as a JAPANESE ANIME CHARACTER on the cover of a monthly anime magazine (in the style of Newtype / ニュータイプ). Keep their face and identity recognizable but rendered in modern Japanese anime illustration style — large expressive eyes, smooth cel-shaded skin, stylized hair, sophisticated futuristic or fantasy costume (could include subtle mecha pilot suit, sci-fi outfit, or stylized seinen aesthetic), dramatic cinematic lighting with blue and silver accents, atmospheric background. Include the silver/blue italic 'Newtype' wordmark at the top with ニュータイプ subtitle, anime-style coverlines in Japanese mentioning ANIME NOW, MECHA SPECIAL, 監督 & 声優 独占, issue No.482, price ¥820. Japanese anime monthly magazine cover layout, ultra-detailed high-quality anime illustration.",
  corocoro:
    "Redraw the person in this photo as a CHIBI-STYLE CARTOON MASCOT CHARACTER on the cover of a Japanese monthly comic-style magazine (in the style of コロコロコミック / CoroCoro Comic). Keep their face recognizable but rendered as a stylized 90s-style chibi/SD cartoon illustration (NOT a photo) — big rounded chibi head, large sparkling cartoon eyes, simple bold black outlines, exaggerated cheerful cartoon expression giving a thumbs-up or peace sign pose, exaggerated cartoony chibi proportions, vibrant primary-color palette (red, yellow, blue), bright cartoon background with action shapes. Pure cartoon illustration style, completely non-photographic. Include the iconic colorful コロコロコミック wordmark at the top with bright wavy backgrounds, scattered cheerful sticker badges in Japanese (新連載!, 超大付録!!, 巻頭カラー), exclamation marks, issue info ¥600, '毎月15日発売 · みんなの宝物'. Japanese cartoon comic magazine cover layout, super vibrant and cheerful chibi cartoon style.",
  ribon:
    "Redraw the person in this photo as a SHOUJO MANGA HEROINE on the cover of a Japanese girls' monthly manga magazine (in the style of りぼん / Ribon). Keep their face recognizable but rendered in classic shoujo manga illustration style — huge sparkling starry eyes, long flowing stylized hair, soft delicate features, dreamy hopeful expression, frilly cute outfit (school uniform, lolita dress, or princess gown), surrounded by floating sparkles, hearts, ribbons, and stars. Soft dreamy pink-and-pastel color palette. Include the iconic pink 'りぼん' wordmark in white-with-pink-outline brush calligraphy at the top center, decorative star and heart stickers, coverlines in Japanese mentioning ときめき, 恋する every day, etc., issue No.812, ¥580, '毎月3日発売', '少女漫画の王国'. Japanese shoujo manga monthly magazine cover layout, sparkly and adorable.",
  shonenmagazine:
    "Redraw the person in this photo as a SHONEN MANGA CHARACTER on the cover of Kodansha's Weekly Shonen Magazine (週刊少年マガジン). Keep their face and identity recognizable but rendered in dynamic Japanese shonen manga illustration style — bold black outlines, expressive determined eyes, dynamic action pose, stylized hair, sports uniform or fantasy battle outfit, speed lines and impact effects in the background, vibrant cel-shaded colors but with a dominant BLUE color palette (contrast to Jump's red). Include the iconic blue 週刊少年マガジン wordmark at the top with yellow accents, multiple coverline blocks in Japanese (巻頭カラー!!, 新章開幕, 熱血スポーツ), a blue rectangular SPECIAL READ NOW badge, issue No.34, price ¥390, '毎週水曜日発売 · 講談社'. Kodansha shonen manga magazine cover layout, ultra-detailed manga illustration.",
  shonensunday:
    "Redraw the person in this photo as a SHONEN MANGA CHARACTER on the cover of Shogakukan's Weekly Shonen Sunday (週刊少年サンデー). Keep their face recognizable but rendered in classic Japanese shonen manga illustration style — softer warmer linework than typical battle manga, often suggesting romantic comedy, mystery, or sports genres (think the publisher of Detective Conan, Inuyasha), thoughtful expression, school uniform or detective-style outfit, dynamic but more grounded pose, warm color palette dominated by ORANGE and YELLOW. Include the iconic 週刊少年サンデー orange wordmark at the top, a yellow sun-circle SUNDAY badge, mystery/romance coverlines in Japanese (ミステリー 急展開!!, ラブコメ ドキドキ青春!), issue No.42, ¥350, 小学館. Shogakukan shonen Sunday magazine cover layout, ultra-detailed manga illustration.",
  ciao:
    "Redraw the person in this photo as a SUPER-CUTE SHOUJO MANGA CHARACTER on the cover of Shogakukan's monthly girls' manga magazine ちゃお (Ciao). Keep their face recognizable but rendered as a stylized cute shoujo manga illustration (chibi-style cartoon character drawing, NOT a photo) — large sparkling cartoon eyes, cute round cartoon face shape, vibrant colorful outfit drawn in manga style (frilly dress, fantasy princess gown, or cute mascot-themed outfit), cheerful peace-sign or thumbs-up cartoon pose, surrounded by floating colorful dots, stars, hearts, and ribbons in pink, blue, yellow, green. Bright multi-color rainbow palette much more vibrant than Ribon. Pure cartoon illustration style, completely non-photographic. Include the iconic large pink 'ちゃお' brush-calligraphy wordmark at the top, a yellow circular 新連載!! badge, a blue 超豪華付録!! rectangular badge, '小学館の少女まんが', '巻頭オールカラー', '毎月3日発売 · 女の子の夢の世界'. Cute Japanese cartoon shoujo manga magazine cover layout, super vibrant and adorable cartoon illustration.",
  youngjump:
    "Redraw the person in this photo as the cover star of a Japanese weekly entertainment and manga magazine for young adults (in the style of Weekly Young Jump / 週刊ヤングジャンプ). Keep their face and identity recognizable. Style them as a popular Japanese young celebrity in a photo shoot — bright cheerful smile, fashionable summer outfit such as a stylish sundress, denim shorts and t-shirt, or trendy casual streetwear, posing relaxed and confident. Bright outdoor or clean studio background with warm sunny lighting, healthy energetic mainstream commercial photography atmosphere. Ultra-detailed glossy magazine quality. Include the wordmark at top (red 'ヤング' label + bold yellow 'ジャンプ'), a black top bar, coverlines in Japanese about manga and entertainment (巻頭撮り下ろし, 夏の独占特集, 新連載 BATTLE OF THE YEAR), a red circular '独占撮影' stamp badge, issue No.36, ¥420, WEEKLY YOUNG JUMP. Japanese entertainment weekly magazine cover layout.",
  weeklyplayboy:
    "Redraw the person in this photo as the cover star of a popular Japanese weekly entertainment lifestyle magazine sold in convenience stores. Keep their face and identity recognizable. Style them as a cheerful celebrity in a summer fashion photo shoot — wearing a stylish summer outfit such as a colorful sundress, casual button-down shirt with shorts, breezy linen ensemble, or trendy summer fashion, possibly holding a parasol or wearing a sun hat. Bright outdoor setting like a sunny boardwalk, vibrant seaside cafe, or sunlit garden. Warm cheerful natural sunlight, wide friendly smile, healthy energetic atmosphere. Japanese mainstream commercial magazine photography style, ultra-detailed glossy magazine quality. Include a bold red Japanese magazine wordmark at the top spelling '週刊プレイボーイ' in stylized characters, coverlines in Japanese (巻頭独占, 今夏の注目特集, 完全保存版 60 PAGE, BEST OF SUMMER 2026, スマイル), issue No.32, ¥520. Japanese mainstream entertainment weekly magazine cover layout.",
