  album_rock:
    "IMPORTANT: This is a VINTAGE ROCK LP ALBUM COVER — NOT a magazine. Transform the person in this photo into the cover artist of a classic rock LP vinyl record (60s-70s psychedelic rock aesthetic). Keep their face recognizable. Style as a vintage rock musician — long tousled hair, brooding intense expression, vintage 60s/70s outfit (suede jacket, denim, leather), dramatic atmospheric lighting. Warm vintage film tones with possible psychedelic color treatment, film grain. Vintage LP cover layout: band/artist name in psychedelic or bold serif typography, album title in distinct font, vintage record label badge, subtle '33⅓ RPM' marking. Vintage rock LP vinyl cover layout.",
