  album_indie:
    "IMPORTANT: This is an INDIE FOLK ALBUM COVER — NOT a magazine. Transform the person in this photo into the cover artist of an indie folk album (Bon Iver / Sufjan Stevens / Fleet Foxes aesthetic). Keep their face recognizable. Style as an introspective indie artist — natural unstyled appearance, casual layered fashion (knitwear, vintage jacket, hat), pensive thoughtful expression, atmospheric natural setting (forest, lake, vintage car). Muted earthy color palette with film grain or hand-drawn elements. Indie DIY aesthetic. Indie album layout: artist name in modest minimal typography, album title in indie hand-drawn or simple sans-serif font, possibly with hand-drawn illustration elements. Indie folk album cover layout.",
  album_edm:
