  ad_perfume:
    "IMPORTANT: This is a LUXURY PERFUME ADVERTISEMENT POSTER — NOT a magazine. Transform the person in this photo into the model of a luxury perfume ad (Chanel / Dior / Tom Ford aesthetic). Keep their face recognizable. Style as an elegant perfume ambassador — refined sophisticated attire, ethereal lighting, contemplative tasteful expression, dreamy luxurious setting. Color palette: champagne gold, deep black, ivory, soft pink. Possibly with the perfume bottle subtly suggested (fictional brand). Luxury perfume ad layout: fictional fragrance name in elegant italic serif typography, brand name in classic serif, 'EAU DE PARFUM' label, poetic tagline like 'L'ESSENCE DE VOUS'. Luxury perfume advertisement poster layout.",
  ad_sportscar:
    "IMPORTANT: This is a LUXURY SPORTS CAR ADVERTISEMENT POSTER — NOT a magazine. Transform the person in this photo into the campaign hero of a luxury sports car ad (Ferrari / Porsche / Lamborghini aesthetic). Keep their face recognizable. Style as a confident driver/owner — sleek sophisticated attire, refined wealthy attitude, atmospheric setting suggesting speed and luxury (race track, alpine road, urban night, sleek garage), possibly with a sports car silhouette in background (fictional brand). Dark moody palette with metallic accents. Sports car ad layout: fictional car model name in bold modern typography, brand emblem-style logo placeholder, performance tagline like 'PRECISION IN MOTION', technical specs text. Luxury sports car advertisement poster.",
  ad_luxury:
