  reality_variety:
    "IMPORTANT: This is a VARIETY SHOW PROMOTIONAL POSTER — NOT a magazine. Transform the person in this photo into the cast member of a Japanese/Korean variety show poster. Keep their face recognizable. Style as a cheerful variety show cast member — bright cheerful expression with big smile or comedic pose, casual stylish outfit, bright energetic studio backdrop or playful set. Bold colorful palette (yellow, red, blue, green primary colors). Variety show poster layout: show name in bold playful typography (sticker/badge elements), cast names in colorful tags, broadcast network logo, episode airing day/time, big bold tagline like 'NEW SEASON STARTS NOW'. Korean/Japanese variety show promotional poster layout.",
