    "IMPORTANT: This is a DYSTOPIAN PROPAGANDA POSTER (fiction) — NOT a magazine. Transform the person in this photo into the citizen subject of a dystopian poster (1984 Orwellian / V for Vendetta aesthetic). Keep their face recognizable. Style with a dystopian propaganda feel — pale rigid expression, uniform government-issue jumpsuit or austere clothing, dim industrial atmosphere, surveillance-state backdrop. Cold palette (concrete grey, sickly green, dark red). Dystopian poster layout: propaganda slogans in bold sans-serif (e.g., 'THE STATE PROTECTS YOU' / 'BIG BROTHER IS WATCHING'), citizen number, year, fictional regime symbol or warning icons. Dystopian fictional propaganda poster layout.",
