  // 🎨 艺术展览海报 (5)
  art_biennale:
    "IMPORTANT: This is a CONTEMPORARY ART BIENNALE POSTER — NOT a magazine. Transform the person in this photo into the featured artist of an international art biennale (Venice Biennale / Documenta aesthetic). Keep their face recognizable. Style as an enigmatic contemporary artist — minimalist refined attire (intellectual aesthetic), pensive intense gaze, atmospheric gallery or installation setting. Refined palette (often muted with single accent color). Biennale poster layout: exhibition name in modern minimalist sans-serif typography, artist name in clean text, exhibition dates, venue (museum/biennale name), curator name. International contemporary art biennale poster layout, minimalist and refined.",
  art_solo:
    "IMPORTANT: This is a SOLO ART EXHIBITION POSTER — NOT a magazine. Transform the person in this photo into the featured artist of a solo art exhibition. Keep their face recognizable. Style as a contemplative artist — wearing artist's smock, paint-stained workwear, or refined gallery-opening attire, atmospheric studio setting with artworks suggested in background, soft natural lighting. Refined artistic palette. Solo exhibition poster layout: the artist's name as the largest element (often centered or top), exhibition title or theme in subdued typography, gallery name, exhibition dates, curator/sponsor info. Solo art exhibition poster layout, minimalist and artist-focused.",
  art_photography:
