    seiso: " === PERSONA: 清純系 (Seiso) === Style the subject with the iconic Japanese 清楚 vibe: sleek long natural-brown or black straight hair, minimal barely-there natural makeup, gentle warm expression with a soft serene smile, refined elegant clothing in white/cream/soft pastel tones, an aura of refined purity and quiet elegance.",
    kawaii: " === PERSONA: 可愛系 (Kawaii) === Style the subject as a classic kawaii cute girl: soft wavy or curled hair, bright doll-like makeup, bright happy expression with a playful big smile, cute outfit with frills and pastel colors, an aura of bubbly cuteness.",
