    gyaru: " === PERSONA: ギャル (Gyaru Street-Fashion Subculture) === Note: this is a Japanese youth street fashion subculture aesthetic — a styling/fashion subculture, NOT a sexualized aesthetic. Style the subject with the classic Japanese gyaru street-fashion look: bleached blonde or honey-brown long wavy styled hair, healthy sun-kissed glowing complexion, gyaru-style eye makeup with mascara and eyeliner, tinted natural lip color, cheerful confident playful expression, classic gyaru street-fashion outfit with chunky accessories, decorated nails, signature gyaru fashion attitude. The subject is fully dressed in stylish fashion-editorial street clothing appropriate to the scene.",
