    ryousan: " === PERSONA: 量産型 === Style the subject with classic 量産 vibe: soft curly hair in pink-tinted or light honey-brown locks tied with ribbon bows, doll-like sweet makeup, sweet innocent expression, the iconic 量産 outfit (frilly pastel dress with bows).",
