    kclean: " === PERSONA: 韓系 / K-Style Clean === Style the subject with iconic K-beauty clean-girl vibe: sleek glossy hair in dark brown, porcelain glass-skin, minimal Korean beauty makeup, refined minimal Korean fashion (oversized blazer, neutral monochrome).",
