    business: " === PERSONA: 商业精英 (Business Elite CEO Male) === Style the subject as a polished male business executive: sharp well-styled short hair, confident composed expression, perfectly tailored sharp business suit with crisp shirt, well-groomed clean shave, classic luxury watch.",
