    dawn:
      " === TIME OF DAY: DAWN / EARLY MORNING (5-6 AM) === Set the scene at the magical dawn hour just before sunrise — sky in deep blue-purple-pink gradient transitioning from indigo to soft peach near the horizon, cool blue ambient light over the environment, soft pre-sunrise glow, faint mist or haze in the air, mostly empty quiet streets, the world just waking up, atmospheric peaceful early-dawn mood. Subject's skin lit by cool soft pre-sunrise light, calm contemplative atmosphere.",
