    noon:
      " === TIME OF DAY: HIGH NOON (12-1 PM) === Set the scene at high noon under direct overhead sunlight — sun directly above, harsh hard shadows directly below objects, intense bright top-down lighting, vivid saturated daylight colors, strong contrast, summer-noon high-key intensity. Subject under intense overhead sun with dramatic hard shadows under brows/nose/chin, hot bold midday atmosphere.",
    afternoon:
