    rainy:
      " === TIME OF DAY/WEATHER: RAINY DAY === Set the scene during rainfall — visible streaks of rain in the air, wet glistening reflective ground with puddles reflecting lights and color, holding or near an umbrella, atmospheric moody melancholic rainy ambience, soft diffused light through rain clouds, romantic cinematic rain-soaked atmosphere. Subject lit by soft diffused rainy daylight with raindrops catching light on hair and clothes, neon/streetlight reflections shimmering in puddles around them.",
    snowy:
